[h2]Build 0.9.22[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Red "no parts vulnerable to frostbite" error on startup. Riimba still cannot get frostbite.
[*]Trash chute and buried trash chute can be drag-placed again (as a line or an angled line), and no longer raise an XML error on startup.
[*]"Is minifiable but not in any thing category" error for the control station. A crated station now appears in stockpile filters.
[*]Mod list warning about the Vanilla Recycling Expanded dependency missing a Workshop link.
[/list]
